flowchart LR
    HOST[开发主机] --> ACCESS{USB/ADB/SSH/Network}
    ACCESS -- 权限或连接失败 --> DIAG[先检查udev/网络/凭据\n不修改应用]
    ACCESS -- 连接通过 --> LINUX[UNO Q Debian Linux\nMPU用户空间]
    LINUX --> FS[文件系统/配置/日志]
    LINUX --> PROC[进程/权限/服务]
    LINUX --> BRIDGE[Bridge/arduino-app-cli\n请求/状态]
    BRIDGE --> MCU[STM32U585 MCU\nZephyr实时控制]
    MCU --> IO[GPIO/PWM/ADC/UART/SPI/I2C]
    IO --> MCU
    MCU --> BRIDGE
    BRIDGE --> RESULT[状态/结果/时间戳]
    LINUX --> OBS[观测\nps/ss/df/logs]
    OBS --> RESULT
    LINUX -- 不直接绕过 --> SAFE[MCU状态机和安全输出]
